# Field table: a subset of Nasdaq TotalView-ITCH 5.0 (public specification,
# "Nasdaq TotalView-ITCH 5.0", revision of April 28, 2023). Offsets are 0-based within
# the message. The layer is written without a length: in MoldUDP64 packets each
# message is preceded by a 2-byte big-endian length that excludes itself
# (decode_mold); in SoupBinTCP it is the payload of a SequencedData packet (decode).
@venue nasdaq
@endian big
@pad space
@type Integer uint
@type Price uint
@type Alpha char

### itch::from_nasdaq
@framed_decode mold 2 exclusive

MessageType S 0 1 # SystemEvent: start and end of the system and market hours (ITCH 5.0, 1.1)
@size 12
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Always 0
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
EventCode Alpha 11 1 # O start of messages, S start of system hours, Q start of market hours, M end of market hours, E end of system hours, C end of messages

MessageType A 0 1 # AddOrder: a new order without MPID attribution (ITCH 5.0, 1.3.1)
@size 36
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
OrderReferenceNumber Integer 11 8 # Unique for the day
BuySellIndicator Alpha 19 1 # B buy, S sell
Shares Integer 20 4 # Displayed quantity
Stock Alpha 24 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
Price Price 32 4 # Price(4): 4 implied decimal places

MessageType E 0 1 # OrderExecuted: part or all of a resting order executed (ITCH 5.0, 1.4.1)
@size 31
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
OrderReferenceNumber Integer 11 8 # The order executed
ExecutedShares Integer 19 4 # Shares executed
MatchNumber Integer 23 8 # Unique for the day

MessageType X 0 1 # OrderCancel: part of a resting order cancelled (ITCH 5.0, 1.4.3)
@size 23
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
OrderReferenceNumber Integer 11 8 # The order reduced
CancelledShares Integer 19 4 # Shares removed

MessageType D 0 1 # OrderDelete: a resting order removed (ITCH 5.0, 1.4.4)
@size 19
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
OrderReferenceNumber Integer 11 8 # The order deleted

### end
